    LLM: "Bid on strength: runs, marriages, aces. Pass best trump to declarer. Lead trump to draw opponents' trumps. Save high counters for tricks. Melds matter especially near the end.\n\nMeld order: show runs and marriages first. Save high counters for tricks. Don't overbid with weak hands.\n\nCount meld and trick points. Declarer needs ~250 from meld plus tricks. Passing: send aces and trump; get back non-counters.",
